{"seq":3,"slug":"fault-diagnosis-consistency-audit","title":"故障诊断、性能排查与一致性审计实操","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/etcd-raft-consensus-production-internals/consistency-observability/fault-diagnosis-consistency-audit","wordCount":2102,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"故障诊断-性能排查与一致性审计实操\">故障诊断、性能排查与一致性审计实操</h1><p>订单集群的 <code>etcd_mvcc_db_total_size_in_bytes</code> 触到配额，<code>NOSPACE</code> 把集群切进「只接受读与删除」的维护模式，下单 Txn 全部返回 <code>ErrGRPCNoSpace</code>。多数 etcd 故障重启治不了，也不能靠单个指标定位：日志复制、租约、压缩三条链路共用同一套 revision 计数（见 <a href=\"../lease-watch-mvcc/mvcc-revision-store-model\">MVCC revision 存储模型</a>），任一入口的滞后都会在另一入口显形。本文按「读健康 → 读状态 → 读哈希 → 定量 → 处置」的顺序，把诊断、排查与审计串成一条证据链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三层信号面与一条证据链\">核心概念：三层信号面与一条证据链</h2><p>etcd 的信号面彼此正交，诊断先定层再动手。<code>/readyz?verbose</code> 会逐项列出 <code>data_corruption</code>、<code>serializable_read</code>、<code>linearizable_read</code> 三个检查，并支持 <code>?exclude=</code> 屏蔽单项（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/op-guide/monitoring/\">etcd Monitoring</a>）——<code>livez</code> 只说明进程活着，「可服务」却必须三个检查同时成立。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号面</th>\n<th>入口</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>典型误用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存活/就绪</td>\n<td><code>/livez</code>、<code>/readyz?verbose</code></td>\n<td>进程要不要重启、能否接流量</td>\n<td>拿 <code>livez</code> 当健康证据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态</td>\n<td><code>endpoint status</code>、<code>endpoint health</code></td>\n<td>谁是 leader、复制到哪、磁盘多大</td>\n<td>只看 <code>IS LEADER</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性证据</td>\n<td><code>endpoint hashkv</code>、<code>snapshot status</code>、Prometheus</td>\n<td>各成员 KV 是否真的相同</td>\n<td>不固定 revision 就比对</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>唯一能直接证明「两台成员状态相同」的量是 KV 历史哈希。设成员 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 在 revision <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 上的哈希为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_i(r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，则该 revision 上的一致性判据是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>且</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>rev</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>j</mi><mtext>rev</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall i,j:\\ H_i(r) = H_j(r) \\quad \\text{且}\\quad r_i^{\\text{rev}} = r_j^{\\text{rev}} = r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">且</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rev</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0975em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rev</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第二个等号常被忽略：<code>endpoint hashkv</code> 默认对<strong>各自的最新 revision</strong> 求哈希，两台成员索引不同时哈希不同是正常的，不能据此判不一致（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/tasks/operator/how-to-check-cluster-status/\">How to check cluster status</a>）。审计必须先固定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;告警触发&lt;br/&gt;NOSPACE / 延迟 / leader 抖动&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;livez 活着?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| C[&quot;进程级故障&lt;br/&gt;看 crash/OOM/FD&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| D{&quot;readyz?verbose 全绿?&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|data_corruption| E[&quot;数据损坏&lt;br/&gt;走快照恢复&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|linearizable_read 失败| F[&quot;失去 quorum 或磁盘慢&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| G[&quot;endpoint status&lt;br/&gt;比对 RAFT INDEX / APPLIED INDEX&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;endpoint hashkv --rev=r&lt;br/&gt;固定 revision 比对哈希&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I{&quot;哈希一致?&quot;}&#10;    I --&gt;|是| J[&quot;非一致性问题&lt;br/&gt;转向性能排查&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt;|否| K[&quot;冻结写入&lt;br/&gt;同快照恢复全部成员&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"告警触发&lt;br/&gt;NOSPACE / 延迟 / leader 抖动\"] --&gt; B{\"livez 活着?\"}\n    B --&gt;|否| C[\"进程级故障&lt;br/&gt;看 crash/OOM/FD\"]\n    B --&gt;|是| D{\"readyz?verbose 全绿?\"}\n    D --&gt;|data_corruption| E[\"数据损坏&lt;br/&gt;走快照恢复\"]\n    D --&gt;|linearizable_read 失败| F[\"失去 quorum 或磁盘慢\"]\n    D --&gt;|是| G[\"endpoint status&lt;br/&gt;比对 RAFT INDEX / APPLIED INDEX\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"endpoint hashkv --rev=r&lt;br/&gt;固定 revision 比对哈希\"]\n    H --&gt; I{\"哈希一致?\"}\n    I --&gt;|是| J[\"非一致性问题&lt;br/&gt;转向性能排查\"]\n    I --&gt;|否| K[\"冻结写入&lt;br/&gt;同快照恢复全部成员\"]</pre><p>这张树的顺序不是随意的：先排进程级问题，再排 quorum 问题，最后才动一致性——一致性证据的采集本身要读写集群，集群已不健康时采集会放大伤害。若诊断落回「非一致性问题」，后续工作在指标口径上，见同章节的 <a href=\"metrics-health-alerting\">指标、健康检查与告警口径</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"故障诊断-状态面板的字段怎么读\">故障诊断：状态面板的字段怎么读</h2><p><code>etcdctl endpoint status --write-out=table</code> 列出的字段里，真正决定诊断方向的是 <code>RAFT TERM</code>、<code>RAFT INDEX</code>、<code>RAFT APPLIED INDEX</code> 与 <code>ERRORS</code>（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/tasks/operator/how-to-check-cluster-status/\">How to check cluster status</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>异常读法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>RAFT TERM</code></td>\n<td>当前任期</td>\n<td>各成员相差很大 = 刚发生选举，未收敛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>RAFT INDEX</code></td>\n<td>已持久化到 WAL 的最后一条日志</td>\n<td>落后 leader 很多 = 复制滞后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>RAFT APPLIED INDEX</code></td>\n<td>已 apply 到状态机的最后一条</td>\n<td>比 INDEX 落后很多 = apply 卡住</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ERRORS</code></td>\n<td>成员自身报错</td>\n<td>非空优先看，常是 NOSPACE 或 CORRUPT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DB SIZE</code></td>\n<td>后端物理占用</td>\n<td>逼近配额 = 即将 NOSPACE</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>RAFT INDEX</code> 与 <code>RAFT APPLIED INDEX</code> 的差值是最被低估的诊断量：持久化到 WAL 只说明「日志安全」，apply 到 MVCC 才说明「键可见」。若某成员 INDEX 已追上 leader 但 APPLIED INDEX 长期不动，问题在本地磁盘或某个超大 Txn 的 apply，而<strong>不在网络</strong>。判定 follower 复制异常与日志分歧的完整入口见 <a href=\"../etcd-raft-log-replication/log-divergence-follower-lag-ops\">日志分歧修复、慢 Follower 与复制异常运维</a>。</p>\n<p>三个起手命令（<code>endpoint health</code> 返回的是一次提案提交的耗时，比纯 TCP 探活信息量大）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"etcdctl --endpoints=$EP endpoint health&#10;etcdctl --endpoints=$EP endpoint status --write-out=table&#10;etcdctl --cluster endpoint hashkv --write-out=table\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --endpoints=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$EP</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> health</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --endpoints=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$EP</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --write-out=table</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --cluster</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hashkv</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --write-out=table</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"性能排查-磁盘-提案与网络三条延迟带\">性能排查：磁盘、提案与网络三条延迟带</h2><p>延迟几乎总由几条串联的延迟带决定，定位时按「谁占了 p99」而非「谁平均慢」来排。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>延迟带</th>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>健康判据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>WAL fsync</td>\n<td><code>etcd_disk_wal_fsync_duration_seconds</code></td>\n<td>p99 稳定，抖升 = 磁盘争用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backend commit</td>\n<td><code>etcd_disk_backend_commit_duration_seconds</code></td>\n<td>同上，bbolt 提交增量快照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提案积压</td>\n<td><code>etcd_server_proposals_pending</code></td>\n<td>不持续上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提交-应用差</td>\n<td><code>proposals_committed_total − proposals_applied_total</code></td>\n<td>高负载下不超过「几千」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对等 RTT</td>\n<td><code>etcd_network_peer_round_trip_time_seconds</code></td>\n<td>同机房应远低于选举超时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Leader 抖动</td>\n<td><code>etcd_server_leader_changes_seen_total</code></td>\n<td>长时间不增长</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>官方 metrics 页给出的唯一量化指引是：已提交与已应用提案数的差值「即便在高负载下也应保持在几千以内」（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/metrics/\">etcd Metrics</a>）。对 <code>wal_fsync</code> 与 <code>backend_commit</code> 两条直方图，该页<strong>未给出毫秒阈值</strong>，只说高时延通常指示磁盘问题——阈值须按自己的盘型与 SLA 定，不能照抄网上的数字。</p>\n<p>写入延迟可写成可加形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>write</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>client</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>broadcast</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>quorum-fsync</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>apply</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{write}} \\approx T_{\\text{client}} + T_{\\text{broadcast}} + T_{\\text{quorum-fsync}} + T_{\\text{apply}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">write</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">client</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">broadcast</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">quorum-fsync</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">apply</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>quorum-fsync</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{quorum-fsync}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">quorum-fsync</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由<strong>最慢的那个多数派成员</strong>决定——这解释了一个反直觉现象：把最强的 NVMe 装到 leader 上，对写入延迟几乎无帮助，优化 p99 必须对齐多数派中最差的盘。fsync 抖动还会推高选举概率，选举期间写入被阻塞，形成「抖动 → 选举 → 更多抖动」的正反馈；对 fsync p99 设告警是打断该反馈的最低成本手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一致性审计-不重启也能取证的证据链\">一致性审计：不重启也能取证的证据链</h2><p>生产环境做一致性审计的前提是<strong>可复现、可核验、无副作用</strong>。三条证据按强度排序：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>readyz 三项检查</strong>：全绿是「可服务」的必要条件，却不是「成员彼此一致」的充分条件。</li>\n<li><strong><code>endpoint hashkv</code> 固定 revision 比对</strong>：先读 leader 的 revision，再对全体成员在<strong>同一 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></strong> 上求哈希，这是最强的在线一致性证据；<code>HASH REVISION</code> 列必须全部相等才有比对意义。可核验片段：<code>R=$(etcdctl endpoint status -w json | grep -o &#39;&quot;revision&quot;:[0-9]*&#39; | grep -o &#39;[0-9]*&#39;)</code>，随后 <code>etcdctl --cluster endpoint hashkv --rev=$R --write-out=table</code>。</li>\n<li><strong><code>snapshot status</code> 读快照内嵌 HASH</strong>：<code>etcdctl snapshot save b.db</code> 后 <code>etcdutl snapshot status b.db</code> 输出 HASH / REVISION / TOTAL KEYS / TOTAL SIZE，用于判断某份备份是否来自已知良好状态（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/op-guide/maintenance/\">etcd Maintenance</a>）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>审计基线还必须记录每个成员的 <code>VERSION</code>：滚动升级期间集群按<strong>最低版本成员的协议</strong>运行。v3.6 移除了 v2 API（成员须先升到 3.5.32 或更高），并把 <code>CompactHashCheck</code>、<code>InitialCorruptCheck</code> 等开关统一收敛到 <code>--feature-gates</code>（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/upgrades/upgrade_3_6/\">Upgrade 3.6</a>）——审计脚本若还依赖旧的 <code>--experimental-*</code> 标志名，升级后会直接失效，这是升级期最常见的「审计静默失效」。哈希同时覆盖键值与删除墓碑，两台成员若在删除可见性上有分歧，<code>RAFT INDEX</code> 面板看不出来，哈希必然不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"处置手册-从-nospace-到快照恢复\">处置手册：从 NOSPACE 到快照恢复</h2><p>后端超过配额时，etcd 抛出集群级 <code>NOSPACE</code> 并进入只接受读与删除的维护模式，恢复动作有严格顺序（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/op-guide/maintenance/\">etcd Maintenance</a>）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"rev=$(etcdctl --endpoints=:2379 endpoint status -w json | grep -o &#39;&quot;revision&quot;:[0-9]*&#39; | grep -o &#39;[0-9]*&#39;)&#10;etcdctl compact $rev      # 先压缩，丢弃被覆盖的历史版本&#10;etcdctl defrag            # 再整理，把空洞还给文件系统&#10;etcdctl alarm disarm      # 最后解除告警\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">rev</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --endpoints=:2379</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> json</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '\"revision\":[0-9]*'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '[0-9]*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compact</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $rev      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 先压缩，丢弃被覆盖的历史版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> defrag</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            # 再整理，把空洞还给文件系统</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alarm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> disarm</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 最后解除告警</span></span></code></pre></div><p>顺序不能颠倒：<code>compact</code> 只逻辑标记旧 revision 可回收，物理空间仍被 bbolt 占着，直到 <code>defrag</code> 才归还宿主文件系统。两个关键约束：<code>defrag</code> 会<strong>阻塞该成员的读写</strong>直到重建完成，且<strong>不被复制</strong>，默认只作用于本地成员，需显式 <code>--cluster</code> 或逐 member 发起；离线整理用 <code>etcdutl defrag --data-dir &lt;path&gt;</code>，前提是进程已停。</p>\n<p>另一个坑：<code>Put</code>/<code>Txn</code>/<code>LeaseGrant</code> 可能返回 <code>ErrGRPCNoSpace</code>，但请求<strong>仍被 apply 到了后端</strong>——配额在 API 层与 Apply 层各查一次。这意味着「失败」的写入不一定真的没写，客户端重试前必须先对账，否则会产生重复业务记录。</p>\n<p>多数派永久失联时，唯一被官方支持的路径是<strong>从同一份快照恢复全部成员</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"etcdutl snapshot restore snapshot.db \\&#10;  --name m1 --data-dir /var/lib/etcd \\&#10;  --initial-cluster &quot;m1=http://h1:2380,m2=http://h2:2380,m3=http://h3:2380&quot; \\&#10;  --initial-cluster-token $TOKEN \\&#10;  --initial-advertise-peer-urls &quot;http://h1:2380&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">etcdutl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> restore</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> snapshot.db</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> m1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --data-dir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /var/lib/etcd</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --initial-cluster</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"m1=http://h1:2380,m2=http://h2:2380,m3=http://h3:2380\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --initial-cluster-token</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $TOKEN </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --initial-advertise-peer-urls</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"http://h1:2380\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对 <code>m1</code>/<code>m2</code>/<code>m3</code> 各跑一次，只改 <code>--name</code>、<code>--data-dir</code>、<code>--initial-advertise-peer-urls</code>；恢复会替换 member/cluster ID，因此必然是一个<strong>新逻辑集群</strong>。对 watch 密集的系统（如 Kubernetes）应加 <code>--bump-revision</code> 与 <code>--mark-compacted</code>，把 revision 抬到远高于旧值，废弃所有基于旧 revision 的 watch 与 informer 缓存——否则客户端会拿着过期 revision 读到静默的旧数据。<code>--force-new-cluster</code> 虽能保留应用数据，但官方明确「强烈不建议」，因为它会在旧成员仍存活时 panic（<a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/op-guide/recovery/\">etcd Recovery</a>）。直接拷贝 <code>member/snap/db</code> 也危险：它可能缺 WAL 里未落盘的记录，且无内嵌校验和，必须加 <code>--skip-hash-check</code>。</p>\n<p>处置逻辑归结为一张判据表：</p>\n<p>处置逻辑归结为一张判据表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>现象</th>\n<th>是否可自愈</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>少数派 follower 宕机</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>不干预，等待追平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>leader 宕机</td>\n<td>是（约一个选举超时）</td>\n<td>等待重选举，未提交写可能丢失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络分区</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>多数派侧继续，少数派侧不可用；etcd 无 split-brain</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NOSPACE</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>compact → defrag → alarm disarm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多数派永久失联</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>同一快照恢复全部成员</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>data_corruption 检查失败</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>冻结写入，从最近良好快照恢复</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><a href=\"https://etcd.io/docs/v3.6/op-guide/failures/\">etcd Failure modes</a> 明确：已提交的写永不丢失，只有 leader 切换时未提交的条目可能丢失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>诊断的纪律是先分层后动手：<code>livez</code>/<code>readyz</code> 判进程与就绪，<code>endpoint status</code> 判复制与磁盘，<code>endpoint hashkv</code> 固定 revision 判一致性，Prometheus 的延迟带判性能。三者不可互相替代——尤其 hashkv 的两个前提（同一 revision、全体成员）常被跳过，导致「假不一致」或「假一致」。处置侧记住两个不可逆点：<code>defrag</code> 阻塞本地读写且不复制；快照恢复一定产生新逻辑集群，需配 <code>--bump-revision</code>/<code>--mark-compacted</code> 废弃旧 watch。把这条证据链固化成脚本与告警，就是把「猜测」换成「可核验结论」的全部代价。相邻入口还有 <a href=\"../cluster-maintenance/snapshot-backup-defrag-restore\">快照备份、碎片整理与恢复</a> 与 <a href=\"../lease-watch-mvcc/lease-leak-watch-backlog-tuning\">租约泄漏、Watch 堆积与压缩调优</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"故障诊断、性能排查与一致性审计实操","id":"故障诊断-性能排查与一致性审计实操"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三层信号面与一条证据链","id":"核心概念-三层信号面与一条证据链"},{"level":2,"text":"故障诊断：状态面板的字段怎么读","id":"故障诊断-状态面板的字段怎么读"},{"level":2,"text":"性能排查：磁盘、提案与网络三条延迟带","id":"性能排查-磁盘-提案与网络三条延迟带"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性审计：不重启也能取证的证据链","id":"一致性审计-不重启也能取证的证据链"},{"level":2,"text":"处置手册：从 NOSPACE 到快照恢复","id":"处置手册-从-nospace-到快照恢复"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"一致性可观测：指标、健康检查与告警体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/etcd-raft-consensus-production-internals/consistency-observability/metrics-health-alerting"},"next":null}